"change_log": "New Features and Enhancements:\n\n1. Kiosk Mode: A new mode designed for presentations and immersive viewing. It hides controllers and hand-tracking for a distraction-free experience. Access it via the \"Advanced\" button on the control panel.\n\n2. Resume Playback: Added support for resuming videos from where you left off.\n\n3. Menu Button Shortcut: Added the option to open the control panel exclusively using the Menu button to prevent accidental triggers.\n\n4. Performance Optimization: Fixed a lag issue when loading folders with a large number of files (up to 20,000), ensuring smoother browsing.\n", "created_date": 1776761691, "id": "26581020131532645", "version": "1.6.1", "version_code": 2385, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24080849371549746", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26581020131532645"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1884073112134608"}]}, "change_log": "New Features and Enhancements:\n\n1. Kiosk Mode: A new mode designed for presentations and immersive viewing. It hides controllers and hand-tracking for a distraction-free experience. Access it via the \"Advanced\" button on the control panel.\n\n2. Resume Playback: Added support for resuming videos from where you left off.\n\n3. Menu Button Shortcut: Added the option to open the control panel exclusively using the Menu button to prevent accidental triggers.\n\n4. Performance Optimization: Fixed a lag issue when loading folders with a large number of files (up to 20,000), ensuring smoother browsing.\n", "created_date": 1776045813, "id": "26495417963426196", "ve